| 批量通过 | POST | /api/admin/v1/post/review/batch-approve | 批量审核通过 |
| 批量拒绝 | POST | /api/admin/v1/post/review/batch-reject | 批量审核拒绝 |
| 统计 | GET | /api/admin/v1/post/review/stats | 获取审核统计 |

